  "body": "When both a service worker registration and an application cache are\navailable for the navigation of resources, if the navigation is under\nthe scope of a service worker, completely bypass the appcache regardless\nof whether the navigation uses the service worker.\n\nFixes https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=27482.\n",
